     The ssyyssddeeccooddee__ccaapp__rriigghhttss() function outputs a comma-separated list of ca‐
     pability rights at _r_i_g_h_t_s_p to the stream _f_p.

     Note that some capability rights are supersets of others; for example,
     CAP_PREAD is the union of CAP_READ and CAP_SEEK.  ssyyssddeeccooddee__ccaapp__rriigghhttss()
     emits a minimal list of rights whose union is equal to _*_r_i_g_h_t_s_p.  For ex‐
     ample, if both CAP_READ and CAP_SEEK are set in _*_r_i_g_h_t_s_p, then
     ssyyssddeeccooddee__ccaapp__rriigghhttss() will include only CAP_PREAD in the output list.

